; ========================================================
; ♨️ 3D PRINTER FILAMENT DRYER G-CODE
; Target Temperature : 60°C (Heatbed)
; Drying Duration    : 8h (28,800 seconds / 28,800,000 ms)
; Generated by       : Filament Dryer Web Generator
; ========================================================

; --- Safety & Initial Setup ---
M220 S100               ; Reset speed multiplier to 100%
M221 S100               ; Reset flow rate to 100%
M104 S0                 ; Ensure hotend heater is OFF (safety)
G21                     ; Set units to millimeters
G90                     ; Set absolute positioning mode

; --- Toolhead Parking (Away from filament spool) ---
G28                     ; Home all axes
G1 Z60 F1500           ; Lift nozzle up away from bed (60mm)
G1 X10 Y200 F3000         ; Move nozzle to back corner (X10 Y200)

; --- Heatbed Warming Phase ---
M117 Heating bed to 60C ; LCD status message
M140 S60               ; Set heatbed target temperature
M190 S60               ; Wait until bed reaches 60°C

; --- Drying Phase (Timer starts after bed is hot) ---
M117 Drying 8h...      ; LCD status message
G4 P28800000         ; Dwell / pause for 8h

; --- Drying Complete & Cooldown Phase ---
M117 Drying Complete!    ; LCD status message
M140 S0                 ; Turn OFF heatbed
; Audible completion alert
M300 S1000 P10000     ; Beep alert (10s at 1000Hz)
M84                     ; Disable all stepper motors (cool down motors)

; ========================================================
; PROCESS FINISHED. Filament is dried and ready to store.
; ========================================================
